Seti file icons — `definitions.json` and `icons.json` are taken verbatim
from the npm package `seti-icons` 0.0.4 (MIT, Elvis Wolcott,
https://github.com/elviswolcott/seti-icons), which packages the icons of
Seti UI (MIT, Jesse Weed, https://github.com/jesseweed/seti-ui) — the set
Visual Studio Code ships as its default file icon theme.

Vendored rather than depended on (2026-09-16): the package lists svgo and
its types as runtime dependencies, which brought 134 packages into the
lock file for two JSON files. Only the data is taken; the lookup is
reimplemented in `components/FileKindIcon.tsx`.

